WEBVTT

1
00:01:17.583 --> 00:01:21.333
Lord Krishna explains reassuring Arjun, 

2
00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:22.750
that the universal form

3
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.083
was revealed only

4
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.583
by His divine will,

5
00:01:26.583 --> 00:01:27.750
and no one before

6
00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:30.666
Arjun had seen it in this way.

7
00:01:30.666 --> 00:01:33.500
This vision was not the result of Vedic study,

8
00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:37.250
charity, sacrifice, or austerity.

9
00:01:37.250 --> 00:01:38.708
It was granted only

10
00:01:38.708 --> 00:01:42.416
through Lord Krishna's grace.

11
00:01:42.416 --> 00:01:45.458
The universal form, though awe-inspiring,

12
00:01:45.458 --> 00:01:48.750
is not Lord Krishna's eternal form.

13
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.625
Uncomfortable with its terrifying nature,

14
00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:54.958
Arjun then finds peace

15
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:57.666
as Lord Krishna prepares to withdraw this form

16
00:01:57.666 --> 00:02:03.250
and reveal to him a more
familiar and personal one.

17
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:11.541
Lord Krishna understands Arjun's fear

18
00:02:11.541 --> 00:02:14.666
and reassures him that the Vishwarupa

19
00:02:14.666 --> 00:02:16.375
was shown only as a special

20
00:02:16.375 --> 00:02:20.333
display of divine power.

21
00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:23.583
He reminds Arjun that even great rishis,

22
00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:24.458
devas,

23
00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:25.708
and scholars cannot reach

24
00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:29.458
this vision through their own efforts.

25
00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:30.375
This vision

26
00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:31.833
is granted only

27
00:02:31.833 --> 00:02:33.875
through Lord Krishna's grace.

28
00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:36.000
This reinforces the truth

29
00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.000
that devotion is superior to religious

30
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.958
acts or intellectual pursuits.

31
00:02:42.958 --> 00:02:46.166
Arjun, though initially eager to see

32
00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:47.833
the Vishwarupa,

33
00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:50.458
now feels uneasy.

34
00:02:50.458 --> 00:02:53.208
He understands that such an overwhelming vision

35
00:02:53.208 --> 00:02:54.291
prevents a personal

36
00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:57.291
relationship with Lord Krishna.

37
00:02:57.291 --> 00:03:00.250
The Vishwarupa is grand and glorious,

38
00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:03.625
but it does not awaken love or intimacy.

39
00:03:03.625 --> 00:03:06.333
Understanding Arjun's state of mind,

40
00:03:06.333 --> 00:03:08.583
Lord Krishna comforts him

41
00:03:08.583 --> 00:03:12.291
and prepares to reveal a form

42
00:03:12.291 --> 00:03:15.291
that will give him peace.

43
00:03:15.291 --> 00:03:16.375
This exchange

44
00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:19.416
reveals an important truth.

45
00:03:19.416 --> 00:03:21.000
Although divine power

46
00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.916
can inspire wonder,

47
00:03:22.916 --> 00:03:24.708
what draws devotees is Lord

48
00:03:24.708 --> 00:03:27.208
Krishna's personal form.

49
00:03:27.208 --> 00:03:29.625
Arjun wishes to see the four-armed form of

50
00:03:29.625 --> 00:03:30.625
Narayana,

51
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:31.916
and ultimately

52
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:35.000
requests Lord Krishna's two-armed form.

53
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.208
This reflects the soul's longing for a loving

54
00:03:38.208 --> 00:03:40.833
relationship with the Supreme Lord.

55
00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:50.000
When a difficulty comes upon you,

56
00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:53.500
what do you do?

57
00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.458
Understand this:

58
00:03:55.458 --> 00:04:00.000
some of life's truths are found

59
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:05.125
only when we approach them with humility.

60
00:04:05.125 --> 00:04:09.291
Just as Arjun could see My Vishwarupa

61
00:04:09.291 --> 00:04:13.166
not through intellect or religious acts,

62
00:04:13.166 --> 00:04:17.250
but through devotion,

63
00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.791
you too can understand life's

64
00:04:20.791 --> 00:04:24.416
deeper lessons

65
00:04:24.416 --> 00:04:27.833
when you let go of ego and face situations

66
00:04:27.833 --> 00:04:31.791
with an open heart.

67
00:04:31.791 --> 00:04:36.750
You often believe that success or understanding

68
00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:39.958
comes only from your own efforts,

69
00:04:39.958 --> 00:04:42.041
but some experiences

70
00:04:42.041 --> 00:04:44.958
come through humility.

71
00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:49.375
Building good relationships, finding peace of mind,

72
00:04:49.375 --> 00:04:53.541
or gaining true knowledge are examples.

73
00:04:53.541 --> 00:04:55.333
Think about this:

74
00:04:55.333 --> 00:05:00.000
when an important task of yours gets stuck,

75
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:04.041
what do you do? Do you become anxious,

76
00:05:04.041 --> 00:05:10.125
or do you look for a lesson even in this?

77
00:05:10.125 --> 00:05:12.041
When you

78
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:18.250
let go of the need to control,

79
00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:21.750
you begin to accept what life

80
00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.875
is trying to teach you.

81
00:05:23.875 --> 00:05:25.958
Look for goodness

82
00:05:25.958 --> 00:05:28.333
even in difficulties.

83
00:05:28.333 --> 00:05:31.541
When an important task comes to a halt,

84
00:05:31.541 --> 00:05:35.583
trust that there is a lesson

85
00:05:35.583 --> 00:05:38.916
and a benefit hidden in it too.

86
00:05:38.916 --> 00:05:43.708
This thinking transforms stress into peace.

87
00:05:43.708 --> 00:05:47.791
Challenges become opportunities to learn.

88
00:05:47.791 --> 00:05:49.791
Reflect on this.

89
00:05:49.791 --> 00:05:53.375
By becoming humble, you not only see

90
00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:58.125
life more clearly, but also open the path

91
00:05:58.125 --> 00:06:01.708
to deeper relationships.

92
00:06:06.375 --> 00:06:08.375
When your children

93
00:06:08.375 --> 00:06:12.958
seem worried or afraid,

94
00:06:12.958 --> 00:06:15.708
what do you do?

95
00:06:15.708 --> 00:06:17.666
Do you understand their feelings,

96
00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:21.500
or do you ignore them?

97
00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.458
Understand.

98
00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:27.041
Recognising and knowing
your children's feelings

99
00:06:27.041 --> 00:06:28.500
is essential.

100
00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:33.583
Just as Arjun, after seeing My Vishwarupa,

101
00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:35.875
experienced distress,

102
00:06:35.875 --> 00:06:39.041
children too can experience fear,

103
00:06:39.041 --> 00:06:43.125
confusion, and worry

104
00:06:43.125 --> 00:06:44.833
when they face challenges

105
00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:48.833
beyond their understanding.

106
00:06:48.833 --> 00:06:51.916
So what should you do in such moments?

107
00:06:51.916 --> 00:06:54.541
Dismissing their feelings

108
00:06:54.541 --> 00:06:57.625
or putting too much pressure on them

109
00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:00.500
can push them away from you.

110
00:07:00.500 --> 00:07:03.208
Instead, respond with compassion

111
00:07:03.208 --> 00:07:06.458
and patience.

112
00:07:06.458 --> 00:07:11.000
When a child is afraid of going to a new class,

113
00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:12.666
instead of saying,

114
00:07:12.666 --> 00:07:17.250
'there is nothing to be afraid of,'

115
00:07:17.250 --> 00:07:19.166
patiently tell them

116
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:21.833
that this is normal

117
00:07:21.833 --> 00:07:24.416
and that you are with them.

118
00:07:24.416 --> 00:07:26.375
Remember,

119
00:07:26.375 --> 00:07:30.750
reassurance does not mean
lowering expectations,

120
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:34.416
but creating an environment

121
00:07:34.416 --> 00:07:37.291
where children feel safe

122
00:07:37.291 --> 00:07:40.416
and capable.

123
00:07:40.416 --> 00:07:45.083
Discipline and guidance are necessary,

124
00:07:45.083 --> 00:07:48.708
but they are effective

125
00:07:48.708 --> 00:07:51.083
only when accompanied

126
00:07:51.083 --> 00:07:54.041
by love and understanding.

127
00:07:54.041 --> 00:07:56.416
When children feel

128
00:07:56.416 --> 00:07:58.708
that they are valued

129
00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:01.500
and supported,

130
00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.375
they grow stronger

131
00:08:04.375 --> 00:08:07.125
and learn to trust.

132
00:08:07.125 --> 00:08:09.625
They know that when facing

133
00:08:09.625 --> 00:08:13.333
life's difficulties,

134
00:08:13.333 --> 00:08:16.041
their family stands by them.

135
00:08:20.791 --> 00:08:22.708
The greatest wisdom

136
00:08:22.708 --> 00:08:25.958
of good leadership is this:

137
00:08:25.958 --> 00:08:29.333
knowing when to share the full plan

138
00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:30.916
and when to break it

139
00:08:30.916 --> 00:08:34.500
into smaller parts,

140
00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:38.583
so that people remain at ease and confident.

141
00:08:38.583 --> 00:08:40.208
Just as I

142
00:08:40.208 --> 00:08:44.541
first showed Arjun My Vishwarupa,

143
00:08:44.541 --> 00:08:48.125
and then, to calm him,

144
00:08:48.125 --> 00:08:50.916
showed him My familiar form,

145
00:08:50.916 --> 00:08:53.666
in just the same way, leadership

146
00:08:53.666 --> 00:08:57.291
should share the future vision with the organisation.

147
00:08:57.291 --> 00:09:02.250
But at the same time, it should also ensure

148
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:03.750
that employees

149
00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:07.750
feel confidence

150
00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:10.125
and competence in their day-to-day work.

151
00:09:10.125 --> 00:09:12.916
What happens otherwise?

152
00:09:12.916 --> 00:09:16.375
When people see the big picture,

153
00:09:16.375 --> 00:09:19.875
it can inspire them.

154
00:09:19.875 --> 00:09:22.958
But too much information

155
00:09:22.958 --> 00:09:26.750
or pressure can also create anxiety.

156
00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:30.791
So what should a leader do?

157
00:09:30.791 --> 00:09:32.541
Recognise

158
00:09:32.541 --> 00:09:37.083
when someone is feeling stressed,

159
00:09:37.083 --> 00:09:41.458
and then step forward to give reassurance.

160
00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:46.333
Break complex tasks into simpler parts.

161
00:09:46.333 --> 00:09:48.833
This balance helps keep employees

162
00:09:48.833 --> 00:09:53.875
focused and motivated,
without being overwhelmed

163
00:09:53.875 --> 00:09:56.958
by the scale of the work.

164
00:09:56.958 --> 00:10:00.791
By building a supportive
environment, where the goal

165
00:10:00.791 --> 00:10:05.166
and the direction of work are both clear,

166
00:10:05.166 --> 00:10:07.875
leadership helps its team

167
00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:11.000
move forward steadily.

168
00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:13.000
This way, every person

169
00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:16.166
works with confidence for their own

170
00:10:16.166 --> 00:10:18.333
and everyone's success.
